      "updated": 1783951423858,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The upper navbar are inconsistents. They should\nfollow example of the stats upper bar. actually\nrefactor it and make it standard\nWhich you can see has no background nor icons. The\nother screens should follow that example. \n\nthe non selected icons on the botton bar should be\ndarsish gray\n\n",
